### IAM Service - Koleksi Permintaan
###
### Cara pakai:
###   1. Jalankan aplikasi lebih dulu:
###      Windows (PowerShell) : .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
###      Linux dan macOS      : ./mvnw spring-boot:run
###   2. Di editor ini (VS Code / IntelliJ / JetBrains HTTP Client),
###      jalankan permintaan satu per satu dari atas ke bawah.
###   3. Variabel di bawah otomatis terisi dari respons permintaan sebelumnya.
###
### Akun administrator di profil dev:
###   username : admin
###   password : Admin1234

@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminUsername = admin
@adminPassword = Admin1234
@memberUsername = anggota
@memberPassword = Anggota1234

### ============================================================
### 1. AUTENTIKASI
### ============================================================

### Login sebagai administrator
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Login dengan kata sandi salah -> 401 dengan pesan yang sama untuk akun tak dikenal
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "SalahSekali1"
}

### Tukar token refresh -> token lama langsung dicabut
# @name refreshToken
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Pakai token hasil tukar
# @name rotatedToken
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Pakai ulang token pertama -> 401, seluruh sesi dicabut
# Token pertama sudah dicabut oleh permintaan "Tukar token refresh".
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Token hasil tukar ikut mati -> 401
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================================
### 2. PEMBATASAN AKSES
### ============================================================

### Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{host}}/v1/users

### Token tidak valid -> 401
GET {{host}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer token.ngada.atau.salah

### Dengan token administrator -> 200
GET {{host}}/v1/users?size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Buat pengguna biasa lebih dulu, supaya percobaan di bawah punya akun
### Permintaan ini butuh token ADMIN
# @name createMember
POST {{host}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "email": "anggota@mail.com",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

### Dengan token user biasa -> 403
### Daftar pengguna hanya untuk peran ADMIN dan AUDITOR
# @name loginMember
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

GET {{host}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.accessToken}}

### Melihat akun sendiri sebagai user biasa -> 200
### Pengguna biasa hanya boleh melihat akunnya sendiri
GET {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### 3. PENGGUNA
### ============================================================

### Daftar pengguna dengan pencarian
GET {{host}}/v1/users?q=admin&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Minta ukuran halaman berlebihan -> dipotong jadi 50
GET {{host}}/v1/users?size=99999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Urutkan berdasarkan kolom terlarang -> 400
GET {{host}}/v1/users?sort=passwordHash
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Ambil satu pengguna
GET {{host}}/v1/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Buat pengguna dengan username yang sama -> 409
POST {{host}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "email": "anggota.lain@mail.com",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

### Buat pengguna dengan email tidak valid -> 400
POST {{host}}/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tidak-valid",
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "password": "Pendek1"
}

### Ubah sebagian data pengguna
# @name patchMember
PATCH {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anggota.baru@mail.com",
  "version": {{createMember.response.body.version}}
}

### Pakai versi lama -> 409
PATCH {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anggota.lagi@mail.com",
  "version": {{createMember.response.body.version}}
}

### ============================================================
### 4. ROLE
### ============================================================

### Daftar role
GET {{host}}/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Buat role baru -> 201
POST {{host}}/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SUPERVISOR"
}

### Buat role dengan nama tidak valid -> 400
POST {{host}}/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nama dengan spasi"
}

### Berikan role ke pengguna
# @name assignRole
PUT {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleNames": ["USER"],
  "version": {{patchMember.response.body.version}}
}

### Berikan role yang tidak dikenal -> 400
PUT {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleNames": ["TIDAK_ADA"],
  "version": {{assignRole.response.body.version}}
}

### ============================================================
### 5. KATA SANDI
### ============================================================

### Login sebagai anggota
# @name loginMemberSaatIni
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

### Ganti kata sandi sendiri -> 204
PUT {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMemberSaatIni.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{memberPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "PasswordLama1"
}

### Ganti kata sandi orang lain -> 403
PUT {{host}}/v1/users/1/password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{memberPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "PasswordLama1"
}

### Login dengan kata sandi lama -> 401
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "password": "{{memberPassword}}"
}

### Login dengan kata sandi baru -> 200
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "password": "PasswordLama1"
}

### Reset kata sandi oleh administrator -> 204
POST {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "Reset12345"
}

### ============================================================
### 6. NONAKTIFKAN DAN AKTIFKAN
### ============================================================

### Nonaktifkan pengguna -> 204
POST {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login ke akun yang dinonaktifkan -> 403
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{memberUsername}}",
  "password": "Reset12345"
}

### Aktifkan kembali -> 204
POST {{host}}/v1/users/{{createMember.response.body.id}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### 7. JEJAK AUDIT
### ============================================================

### Daftar jejak audit (hanya ADMIN dan AUDITOR)
GET {{host}}/v1/audit-logs?size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Periksa keutuhan rantai hash (hanya ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/v1/audit-logs/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### ============================================================
### 8. LOGOUT
### ============================================================

### Cabut token refresh -> 204
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Pakai token refresh yang sudah dicabut -> 401
POST {{host}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginAdmin.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### ============================================================
### 9. DOKUMENTASI
### ============================================================

### Halaman Swagger UI
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui.html

### Deskripsi OpenAPI (publik di profil dev, mati di profil produksi)
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
